Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:04.00,CN,,0,0,0,,老板们，小企业用 AI
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:04.00,EN,,0,0,0,,Bosses, for small businesses using AI
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.00,0:00:07.00,CN,,0,0,0,,第一步到底该做什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.00,0:00:07.00,EN,,0,0,0,,What should you do first?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.00,0:00:10.50,CN,,0,0,0,,不是买系统，不是招技术
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.00,0:00:10.50,EN,,0,0,0,,Not buying systems, not hiring tech
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.50,0:00:14.10,CN,,0,0,0,,而是找一个重复动作
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.50,0:00:14.10,EN,,0,0,0,,Find one repeated task
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.10,0:00:17.00,CN,,0,0,0,,为什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.10,0:00:17.00,EN,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.00,0:00:22.00,CN,,0,0,0,,很多人用 AI，还停留在聊天窗口里
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.00,0:00:22.00,EN,,0,0,0,,Many people still use AI only in chat
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.00,0:00:27.00,CN,,0,0,0,,写文案、写通知、解释表格
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.00,0:00:27.00,EN,,0,0,0,,Copywriting, notices, spreadsheet explainers
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.00,0:00:32.00,CN,,0,0,0,,它确实挺行
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.00,0:00:32.00,EN,,0,0,0,,It is genuinely useful
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.00,0:00:38.12,CN,,0,0,0,,但关掉窗口以后，公司还是原样跑
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.00,0:00:38.12,EN,,0,0,0,,But after closing it, the business is unchanged
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.12,0:00:41.46,CN,,0,0,0,,过去的 AI 更像聊天机器人
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.12,0:00:41.46,EN,,0,0,0,,Old AI felt more like a chatbot
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.46,0:00:46.32,CN,,0,0,0,,现在它能替你完成一段工作
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.46,0:00:46.32,EN,,0,0,0,,Now it can complete a workflow for you
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.32,0:00:50.40,CN,,0,0,0,,比如营销上
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.32,0:00:50.40,EN,,0,0,0,,For example, in marketing
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.40,0:00:54.70,CN,,0,0,0,,写本地广告、网站文案
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.40,0:00:54.70,EN,,0,0,0,,Local ads and website copy
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.70,0:00:58.50,CN,,0,0,0,,短视频脚本、客户评论回复
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.70,0:00:58.50,EN,,0,0,0,,Short-video scripts and review replies
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.50,0:01:04.46,CN,,0,0,0,,客服上，整理消息并提醒跟进
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.50,0:01:04.46,EN,,0,0,0,,In service, sort messages and remind follow-ups
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.46,0:01:09.20,CN,,0,0,0,,小企业用 AI 最重要的纪律
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.46,0:01:09.20,EN,,0,0,0,,The key rule for small businesses using AI
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.20,0:01:13.00,CN,,0,0,0,,AI 做事，人守门
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.20,0:01:13.00,EN,,0,0,0,,AI does the work, people guard the gate
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.00,0:01:18.50,CN,,0,0,0,,发客户、付款、发布、提交
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.00,0:01:18.50,EN,,0,0,0,,Clients, payments, publishing, submissions
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.50,0:01:23.00,CN,,0,0,0,,都不能直接让 AI 放出去
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.50,0:01:23.00,EN,,0,0,0,,Do not let AI send them out directly
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.00,0:01:26.54,CN,,0,0,0,,必须有人确认一遍
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.00,0:01:26.54,EN,,0,0,0,,A person must review it first
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.54,0:01:30.50,CN,,0,0,0,,具体怎么开始？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.54,0:01:30.50,EN,,0,0,0,,So how do you start?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.50,0:01:35.50,CN,,0,0,0,,列一个“反待办清单”
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.50,0:01:35.50,EN,,0,0,0,,Make an anti-to-do list
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.50,0:01:41.26,CN,,0,0,0,,写下哪些事，你不想再亲手做
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.50,0:01:41.26,EN,,0,0,0,,Write what you no longer want to do by hand
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.26,0:01:45.50,CN,,0,0,0,,注意，只挑一个
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.26,0:01:45.50,EN,,0,0,0,,Remember: pick only one
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.50,0:01:50.50,CN,,0,0,0,,把产品、报价、常见问题整理给 AI
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.50,0:01:50.50,EN,,0,0,0,,Give AI your products, prices, and FAQs
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.50,0:01:54.60,CN,,0,0,0,,让它先在内部跑一周
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.50,0:01:54.60,EN,,0,0,0,,Let it run internally for one week
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.60,0:01:59.50,CN,,0,0,0,,这一周只看三个指标
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.60,0:01:59.50,EN,,0,0,0,,Track only three metrics this week
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.50,0:02:04.20,CN,,0,0,0,,第一，有没有真的省时间
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.50,0:02:04.20,EN,,0,0,0,,First, did it really save time?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.20,0:02:08.70,CN,,0,0,0,,第二，有没有减少漏回复、漏跟进
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.20,0:02:08.70,EN,,0,0,0,,Second, did it reduce missed replies?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.70,0:02:15.78,CN,,0,0,0,,第三，改一改是不是就能用
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.70,0:02:15.78,EN,,0,0,0,,Third, can it work after small tweaks?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.78,0:02:20.00,CN,,0,0,0,,如果不行，先别急着换工具
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.78,0:02:20.00,EN,,0,0,0,,If not, don't rush to switch tools
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.00,0:02:26.00,CN,,0,0,0,,看看资料是不是太少、太旧、太乱
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.00,0:02:26.00,EN,,0,0,0,,Check if your data is too little, old, or messy
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.00,0:02:31.50,CN,,0,0,0,,AI 做不好，很多时候不是模型问题
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.00,0:02:31.50,EN,,0,0,0,,When AI fails, it is often not the model
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.50,0:02:36.10,CN,,0,0,0,,是公司信息还没准备好
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.50,0:02:36.10,EN,,0,0,0,,It is the business info not being ready
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.10,0:02:41.00,CN,,0,0,0,,小企业用 AI，不要先追风口
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.10,0:02:41.00,EN,,0,0,0,,For small businesses, do not chase hype first
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.00,0:02:46.00,CN,,0,0,0,,先省下一个人的半小时
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.00,0:02:46.00,EN,,0,0,0,,Save one person's half hour first
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.00,0:02:51.00,CN,,0,0,0,,半小时省出来，业务跑顺了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.00,0:02:51.00,EN,,0,0,0,,Once time is saved and work runs smoother
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.00,0:02:55.36,CN,,0,0,0,,再谈系统化、自动化、智能化
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.00,0:02:55.36,EN,,0,0,0,,Then talk systems, automation, and intelligence
